Provedordemensageria --> PlataformaExemplo <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Entrega as mensagens recebidas\n<size:16>[Webhook]</size>"
PlataformaExemplo --> Provedordeemail <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Envia e-mail\n<size:16>[HTTPS]</size>"
